  "releaseNotes": "- (1.1.1) Correctness and Performance Fixes\n\n      - Fixed DBNull handling for non-nullable value types during entity materialization,\n      preventing runtime assignment exceptions.\n\n      - Improved entity materialization performance by removing reflection from runtime\n      execution paths and relying on cached metadata and compiled setters.\n\n      - Increased robustness and predictability of SQL-to-entity mapping without\n      introducing breaking changes.\n\n      - Internal refactorings and minor optimizations to improve stability and\n      maintainability of the materialization pipeline.",
